  "description": "SUPERB FOUR-BEDROOM CORPORATE HOME | IMPRESSIVE MODERN EXTENSION | CONVERTED ATTIC | HOME OFFICE | SOUTH-FACING LANDSCAPED GARDEN\n\nMorrison Estates are delighted to present this modern property at Holywell, Dundrum to the rental market — an exceptionally well-presented and generously proportioned four-bedroom home offering an excellent combination of contemporary living, flexible accommodation and a highly sought-after Dundrum location.\n\nThe property has been thoughtfully upgraded and extended to create a particularly impressive home. The accommodation is ideally suited to the corporate and executive rental market, with multiple living and working spaces providing excellent flexibility for modern family life.\n\nThe Property\n\nOn entering, a welcoming entrance hallway leads through to the main accommodation. To the front is a comfortable and well-proportioned living room, while to the rear lies the heart of the home — a modernised kitchen with feature island, providing an attractive and practical space for everyday living.\nThe kitchen opens into a substantial contemporary rear extension, creating a bright and spacious additional dining and entertaining area with a wonderful connection to the garden.\n\nBeyond the main living space is a separate utility room, leading through to a further versatile room which is ideally suited as a home office, playroom or additional bedroom, depending on individual requirements.\n\nUpstairs\n\nThe first floor provides four bedrooms, including a generous principal bedroom with ensuite, together with the main family bathroom off the landing.\nA further staircase leads to the converted attic, providing valuable additional space which could work particularly well as a home office, hobby room, study or occasional bedroom space.\n\nOutside\n\nA particular feature of the property is its attractive south-facing rear garden. Professionally landscaped and designed to complement the extended living accommodation, it provides an excellent private outdoor space for relaxing, dining and entertaining.\n\nLocation\n\nHolywell enjoys a prime and highly convenient location in Dundrum, one of South Dublin’s most established residential areas. The property is well positioned for access to Dundrum Town Centre, local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities, together with excellent transport connections to Dublin city centre and the wider South Dublin area.\n\nThe location also provides convenient access to the Luas and M50, making the property particularly attractive for anyone requiring easy connectivity throughout Dublin.\n\nAccommodation at a Glance\n•\tEntrance hall\n•\tFront living room\n•\tModern kitchen with feature island\n•\tLarge contemporary dining/living extension\n•\tUtility room\n•\tHome office / playroom / additional bedroom\n•\tFour first-floor bedrooms\n•\tPrincipal bedroom with ensuite\n•\tMain family bathroom\n•\tConverted attic room\n•\tLandscaped south-facing rear garden\n\nThis home at Holywell represents a superb opportunity to rent a spacious, modern and highly versatile home in a prime Dundrum setting, combining excellent accommodation with the additional space increasingly sought after by corporate tenants.\n\nBER B\nContact: Lettings Department 01 293 7100\nViewing: By prior appointment.\n______________________________________________________________\n\nPlease Note:\nMorrison Estates & Lettings Limited for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: These particulars do not form any part of any contract and are given as guidance only. Maps and plans are not to scale and measurements are approximate. Intending purchasers/renters must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of details given to them either verbally or as part of this brochure. Such information is given in good faith and is believed to be correct, however, Morrison Estates & Lettings Ltd., or their agents shall not be held liable for inaccuracies. Prices quoted are exclusive of VAT (unless otherwise stated) and all negotiations are conducted on the basis that the purchasers/lessee shall be liable for any VAT arising on the transaction. PSRA License No. 004334",
